/opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0/src/lean/Lean/DocString/Links.lean-58-The internal syntax is the URL scheme `lean-manual` followed by the path `/KIND/MORE...`, where
/opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0/src/lean/Lean/DocString/Links.lean-59-`KIND` is a kind of content being linked to. Presently, the only valid kind is `section`, and it
