codex
I found the precise sandbox incompatibility: Lean 4.22 asks Linux for `/proc/<its-pid>/exe`, while this execution sandbox exposes only `/proc/self/exe`; ordinary processes reproduce the same missing-path behavior. I can safely shim that one read-only path lookup for the required preflight, leaving all audited inputs untouched, and will preserve the shim source/hash and the full rerun output as evidence.
